. 
. * --- how clear are the clusters of the chosen model? ---
. estat clusters, generate(grp) nolist
Classification stored in grp_class, probabilities in grp_p1 to grp_p2.

. tabulate grp_class

  grp_class |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          2 |         71      100.00      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |         71      100.00

. summarize grp_p1 grp_p2

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
      grp_p1 |         71    .3669366    .0465165     .28925        .46
      grp_p2 |         71    .6330634    .0465165        .54     .71075

