. * --- a single starting point instead of the default four ---
. nwlsm lazega_fr, dim(2) clusters(2) sender receiver seed(12) mklstarts(1)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Latent space model (Euclidean distance; bernoulli family), posterior by MCMC
Network: lazega_fr (71 actors, directed)           Latent dimensions: 2
Draws: 4000  burn-in: 10000  interval: 10          Seed: 12
Latent clusters: 2
Posterior mean log likelihood: -1487.138 (sd 11.744)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                              Mean        Sd   MC s.e.  Lower 95% Upper 95%
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
_cons                      -0.1287    0.1458    0.0065    -0.4301    0.1539
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Variance parameters (posterior):
sigma2_1                    2.2718    0.7515    0.0127     1.2880    4.1302
sigma2_2                    2.0309    0.4279    0.0111     1.3329    3.0126
sender_var                  0.4092    0.1102    0.0024     0.2351    0.6691
receiver_var                0.2214    0.0597    0.0012     0.1263    0.3622
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Acceptance rate of the latent positions: 0.239
Latent clusters: estat clusters lists the posterior membership probabilities
and the classification; cluster means e(cmeans), mixing proportions e(lambda).
Positions: minimum Kullback-Leibler estimate e(Z) (also estat positions); mean
of the draws aligned to it e(Zmean); posterior mean distances e(D); posterior
mean tie probabilities e(P). Positions are identified up to rotation,
reflection and translation only.

. estat bic

