. estat gof, gof(distance) nsim(100) seed(1)

Goodness of fit: minimum geodesic distance (100 networks simulated from the post
> erior)
------------------------------------------------------------------
    Distance |  Observed       Min      Mean       Max  MC p-value
-------------+----------------------------------------------------
           1 |       575       496    577.35       647        0.90
           2 |      2316      1856   2272.55      2630        0.88
           3 |      1782      1556   1758.89      2060        0.76
           4 |       154       121    261.43       598        0.12
           5 |         3         0     15.54       121        0.42
           6 |         0         0      0.56        10        1.00
           7 |         0         0      0.02         2        1.00
         Inf |       140         0     83.66       412        0.50
------------------------------------------------------------------
Each simulated network is drawn from the model at one of 100 posterior draws
(evenly spaced over the stored draws). MC p-value: 2 min(P(simulated <=
observed), P(simulated >= observed)), at most 1, as in latentnet. Missing
dyads of the observed network count as no tie.

. 
. * --- a valued network: the number of the three relations (advice, co-work, fr
> iendship) of a pair, 0 to 3 ---
. nwgen lazega_all = lazega_fr + lazega_adv + lazega_cow

. nwsummarize lazega_all
